WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.400
[bell rings]

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.873
[students chattering]

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.575
[chatter fades]

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.194
- I...

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:33.199
AM YOUR SUBSTITUTE...

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:37.537
MR. NOSTRAND.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.873
BUT THAT MIGHT AS WELL SAY,
"NO NONSENSE,"

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.177
BECAUSE I DO NOT PLAY.

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:49.482
NOW, TODAY WILL NOT BE
A DAY OFF.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:53.186
IN FACT, TODAY,
YOU WILL WORK HARDER THAN--

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:54.721
[farts]

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.589
[farts quietly]

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.234
all: [laughing]

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.103
- SEE YOU LATER,
MR. POOTSTRAND!

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.572
DID THAT DUDE
REALLY JUST FART?

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:13.673
- SOMEBODY CALL
A CODE BROWN UP IN HERE.

